    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would be based on our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform would include the following components:  - Document-ingestion pipeline for parsing, chunking, and metadata extraction - Vector store for efficient storage and retrieval of documents - Retrieval layer with hybrid search for querying the document store - Orchestration layer for routing queries through retrieval, generation, and post-processing - Answer layer for generating grounded responses with source citations and retrieval trace." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's would be hosted on OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring high security and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The hosting tier would be the Sovereign tier, which is EU-only and powered by renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, compliance with GDPR, hosting within the EU with no transfer outside the EU, protection of sensitive data (encryption, pseudonymisation where relevant), a complete audit trail, explainability, and respect for auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security and regulatory compliance risks should we flag, and are we compliant?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, I can confirm that we have measures in place to address some of the client's requirements. we are ISO 27001 certified, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, including data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we ISO 27701 certification demonstrates we commitment to privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding hosting, we use OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification, ensuring sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. use aligns with the client's requirement for hosting within the EU with no transfer outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection, we employ encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), as well as key management through we the EU-based infrastructure. we also implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, access controls to prevent cross-client circulation of data, pseudonymisation, and data minimisation. we configurable retention aligns with legal archival obligations, and we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, maintaining a data processing register and making we Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available, aligned with GDPR Article 28. we also provide audit logging, including logs of access and system outputs, supporting explainability and a complete audit trail. we Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) ensures that access to sensitive data is restricted to authorized personnel." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag the following potential security and regulatory compliance risks: 1. **Data transfer outside the EU**: While OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification, is SecNumCloud qualified, ensuring no transfer outside the EU, we must ensure that all we operations and subcontractors adhere to this requirement. 2. **Auditor independence**: we need to verify that our services do not compromise auditor independence, particularly regarding access controls, audit logging, and explainability. 3. **Encryption and pseudonymisation**: Although we employ encryption and pseudonymisation, we should review the client's specific requirements for sensitive data protection to ensure alignment with the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, based on we company context, we are partially compliant with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we have a solid foundation in place for security and regulatory compliance, we need to address the flagged risks and ensure that all aspects of our services meet the client's specific demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects us to comply with professional secrecy, GDPR, anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be a non-decisional assistance tool; the chartered accountant or statutory auditor validates and signs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key legal considerations, and how can us ensure us compliance?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent of us, the Legal Agent of Faber IA can confirm that us is familiar with professional secrecy, having worked with clients bound by professional secrecy before. us also monitor obligations related to GDPR, anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT), auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit, and legal retention obligations for accounting documents through us Security & Compliance function." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance, us will maintain the contractual framework in a way that does not compromise us professional obligations or those of us tooling. us solution, being a non-decisional assistance tool, aligns with the requirement that the chartered accountant or statutory auditor must validate and sign deliverables." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup respects the necessary professional responsibility and independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, us have experience with contractual expectations around service levels, penalties, reversibility, audit rights, and confidentiality undertakings, which will be essential in drafting a compliant contract for this engagement. us platform's intellectual property model, based on proprietary software licensed under a subscription or usage model, also needs to be considered to ensure that Our platform's intellectual property model, based on proprietary software licensed under a subscription or usage model aligns with the client's requirements and legal obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given us experience working with regulated professions and public-sector clients, us are confident in us ability to navigate these legal considerations and ensure compliance throughout us collaboration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget allocated to the project is €220,000 over 3 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain controlled." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, The budget allocated to the project falls within our normal deal range and financial capacity. our target gross margin ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve falls, our will work with the client to select a cost-efficient configuration that protects Our target gross margin while ensuring predictability of recurring costs. our favor tiers and models that support Our target gross margin and will arbitrate accordingly where requirements allow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, maintaining a three-year cost model that can be re-run if budget or requirements change will help our optimize costs and ensure the project remains within budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that provides intelligent assistance for retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and supporting mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements, and what are the potential trade-offs?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company Faber IA has an AI and innovation lead role that can propose a solution based on Our company Faber IA Atelier platform." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company Faber IA can leverage Our company Faber IA Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to provide intelligent assistance for retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, as well as drafting professional documents. our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities ensures that answers are generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, rather than relying on a model's parametric memory." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company Faber IA can also utilize Our company Faber IA template-guided drafting capability to assist in drafting professional documents such as client letters, mission notes, and file syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our Atelier platform can provide support for handling client files and facilitating mission continuity between collaborators by enabling relevant information sharing and efficient resumption of work by another collaborator." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, Our company Faber IA can employ an iterative approach that involves corpus curation with Our company Faber IA experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loop to ensure high-quality outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company Faber IA methodology also includes quality measurement using a labeled evaluation set built with the client, which assesses answer quality based on groundedness, relevance, factual support, and correctness of cited figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, there may be trade-offs in terms of performance versus explainability and sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, Our company Faber IA Sovereign European open-weight model offers fully auditable and reliable results but may have somewhat lower raw performance on complex tasks compared to top-tier proprietary models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "On the other hand, using top-tier proprietary models via API may provide higher performance but with lower internal transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, Our company Faber IA proposed solution can meet the client's requirements for intelligent assistance while ensuring reliability, explainability, and sovereignty of the AI system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current sustainability practices and EcoVadis rating, how can our ensure that the solution meets these expectations, and what are the potential benefits and drawbacks? our have a published CSR statement and an EcoVadis Silver rating, which demonstrates our commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, also conducts a bilan carbone and covers main scope 3 items, including cloud inference, in our GHG reporting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of infrastructure, Our company, Faber IA partner with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU region, uses renewable energy, and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, as well as heat reuse capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This alignment can help minimize the environmental footprint of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
