        ex:hasText "Evaluation criteria  Offers will be evaluated against: quality and relevance of the solution; reliability and traceability of outputs; confidentiality and security; respect of professional secrecy and of auditor independence; data sovereignty; quality of integration with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés production tools; total cost; quality of support; environmental considerations; capacity for innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that improves productivity, quality, and reliability of work while preserving professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project must be conducted progressively with a pilot phase on one office or mission line followed by progressive generalisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what are the key considerations for managing The project, and how can our company's ensure The project successful delivery?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's company context, the key considerations for managing this projectinclude adhering to our company's Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, which includes phases such as Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the client is a regulated, document-intensive organisation, our company's will pay particular attention to confidentiality, existing production tools, and seasonality of workload during the framing phase. our company's past references in the public sector, such as our company's work with a regional council and a mutual health insurer, demonstrate our company's ability to deliver projects in highly regulated environments. our company's can leverage this experience to ensure that our company's solution meets the client requirements for preserving professional secrecy and confidentiality. our company's consortium partners, including OuraneCloud, Ligeo Conseil, and a French public AI research laboratory, will play important roles in hosting, integration, and joint research." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, OuraneCloud will provide sovereign cloud infrastructure, ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ligeo Conseil will support the integration of our company's Atelier platform with the client's existing production tools." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ligeo Conseil have confirmed availability to onboard an engagement of this size within the proposed timeline, including the constraint of a pilot before a closing campaign. our company's dedicated team, consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client to ensure successful delivery. our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee, operational committee, RACI matrix, single point of contact, and documented escalation path, will ensure effective communication and decision-making throughout The project. our company's will also provide change management support and training as part of our solution to facilitate adoption and minimize disruption to the client operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful delivery, our company's will focus on meeting the client requirements for reliability, traceability, and confidentiality, while also ensuring compliance with relevant regulatory constraints, such as GDPR and professional secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's expertise, past experiences, and consortium partners, our company's are well-positioned to deliver a high-quality solution that meets the client's needs and expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects response times below 2 seconds for common queries, a high level of availability during business hours, resilience to seasonal peak loads, and integration with accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment, API-type interfaces, and user directory (SSO)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds for common queries: PARTIALLY COVERED our platform's median latency is 1.3 seconds and p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds, which partially meets each requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High level of availability during business hours: FULLY COVERED Our platform's is designed for high availability during business hours and has built-in monitoring, logging, and observability features to ensure high availability during business hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Resilience to seasonal peak loads: FULLY COVERED Our platform's can scale horizontally to handle seasonal peak loads, such as closing periods and tax campaigns." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED: FULLY COVERED our have connectors and adapters for accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, including accounting-production and payroll software, as well as document-management systems (GED)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment: FULLY COVERED Our platform's can integrate with an electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with API-type interfaces: FULLY COVERED Our platform's has an API-first design, using REST and webhooks, which allows for easy integration with other systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with user directory (SSO): FULLY COVERED our support single sign-on (SSO) protocols such as SAML and OIDC, and can integrate with user directories like LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

